{"seq":1,"slug":"two-phase-locking","title":"两阶段锁与死锁","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/database-transactions-concurrency/concurrency-control/two-phase-locking","wordCount":1422,"readingTime":6,"html":"<h1 id=\"两阶段锁与死锁\">两阶段锁与死锁</h1><p><a href=\"../foundations/serializability-theory\">可串行化理论</a>给了我们一个判据——优先图无环——但它是事后判定：拿到一个完整调度才能画图查环。运行时的数据库不能等事务跑完再判断对错，它需要一个能在加锁那一刻就保证最终无环的规则。两阶段锁就是这样一条规则，它简单到只有一句话，却能严格保证冲突可串行化。它也是最早被广泛采用的并发控制方法，至今活在每个数据库的锁管理器里。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>两阶段锁（2PL）的规则是：每个事务的加锁与放锁分成两个阶段，先是只能加锁不能放锁的「增长阶段」，一旦放了第一把锁就进入「收缩阶段」，此后只能放锁不能再加锁。锁分共享锁（S，读用，可共存）与排他锁（X，写用，独占）两种，兼容关系决定了谁要等谁。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;  T[事务开始] --&gt; G[增长阶段&lt;br/&gt;只加锁 不放锁]&#10;  G --&gt;|持锁数达到峰值| L[锁点 Lock Point]&#10;  L --&gt; SH[收缩阶段&lt;br/&gt;只放锁 不加锁]&#10;  SH --&gt; E[事务结束]&#10;  G --&gt;|加 S 锁| RD[读数据]&#10;  G --&gt;|加 X 锁| WR[写数据]\">graph TD\n  T[事务开始] --&gt; G[增长阶段&lt;br/&gt;只加锁 不放锁]\n  G --&gt;|持锁数达到峰值| L[锁点 Lock Point]\n  L --&gt; SH[收缩阶段&lt;br/&gt;只放锁 不加锁]\n  SH --&gt; E[事务结束]\n  G --&gt;|加 S 锁| RD[读数据]\n  G --&gt;|加 X 锁| WR[写数据]</pre><p>下表是锁兼容矩阵，锁管理器据此决定一个加锁请求能否立即授予。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>已持有 \\ 请求</th>\n<th>共享锁 S</th>\n<th>排他锁 X</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>共享锁 S</td>\n<td>兼容（可同时持有）</td>\n<td>冲突（请求方等待）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>排他锁 X</td>\n<td>冲突（请求方等待）</td>\n<td>冲突（请求方等待）</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"为什么两个阶段就能保证可串行化\">为什么两个阶段就能保证可串行化</h2><p>2PL 保证冲突可串行化的核心是「锁点」概念。每个事务都有一个时刻，它持有的锁数量达到峰值——这就是锁点，是它放第一把锁的前一刻。可以证明：按锁点的先后给事务排序，得到的串行序就与实际调度冲突等价，因此优先图必然无环。</p>\n<p>直觉是：如果 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>T</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T_i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 和 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>T</mi><mi>j</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T_j</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">j</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 在数据 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">x</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span></span></span></span></span> 上冲突，那么谁先拿到 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">x</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span></span></span></span></span> 的锁、谁的锁点就更靠前，而冲突操作的实际先后必然与锁点先后一致——后者要等前者放锁才能加锁，而前者放锁时已过锁点。于是不会出现 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>T</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T_i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">x</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span></span></span></span></span> 上排前、在 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>y</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">y</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">y</span></span></span></span></span> 上排后这种制造环的情况。这把<a href=\"../foundations/serializability-theory\">可串行化理论</a>的事后判据，转化成了运行时可强制的加锁纪律。</p>\n<h2 id=\"严格两阶段锁与级联回滚\">严格两阶段锁与级联回滚</h2><p>朴素 2PL 允许事务在收缩阶段提前放锁，这会带来麻烦：<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>T</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T_1</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 放了 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">x</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span></span></span></span></span> 的写锁、<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>T</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T_2</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 立刻读到 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>T</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T_1</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 写的值，随后 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>T</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T_1</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 回滚——<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>T</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T_2</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 读了脏数据，必须级联回滚。为杜绝这点，几乎所有实现都用严格两阶段锁（S2PL）：所有排他锁一直持有到事务提交或回滚的那一刻才统一释放。</p>\n<p>这样别的事务在 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>T</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T_1</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 提交前读不到、改不了 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>T</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T_1</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 写过的数据，调度变成<a href=\"../foundations/serializability-theory\">可串行化理论</a>里说的严格调度，回滚绝不级联。代价是锁持有时间更长、并发度更低。还有更强的强严格 2PL（SS2PL），连共享锁也持有到提交，是商业数据库锁实现的常见选择。</p>\n<h2 id=\"锁粒度与意向锁\">锁粒度与意向锁</h2><p>锁可以加在不同粒度上：整个表、一个页、一行，甚至一个字段。粒度越细并发越高，但锁的数量越多、管理开销越大；粒度越粗开销越小，但并发越差。一个事务要更新一行，加行锁并发好；但要扫描全表，加成千上万个行锁不如直接加一个表锁。</p>\n<p>问题来了：一个事务想加表级排他锁，怎么知道有没有别的事务正持有这张表里某一行的行锁？逐行检查太慢。意向锁解决了这个问题——加行锁前先在表上加一个意向锁（IS / IX），表示「我打算在这张表的某行加 S / X 锁」。这样表级加锁只需检查表上的意向锁，无需下钻到行。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;  DB[数据库] --&gt; TB[表]&#10;  TB --&gt;|加 IX 意向排他| TB&#10;  TB --&gt; PG[页]&#10;  PG --&gt; ROW[行]&#10;  ROW --&gt;|加 X 排他锁| ROW&#10;  TB -.表级请求先看意向锁.-&gt; CHK[快速判断能否授予表锁]\">graph TD\n  DB[数据库] --&gt; TB[表]\n  TB --&gt;|加 IX 意向排他| TB\n  TB --&gt; PG[页]\n  PG --&gt; ROW[行]\n  ROW --&gt;|加 X 排他锁| ROW\n  TB -.表级请求先看意向锁.-&gt; CHK[快速判断能否授予表锁]</pre><h2 id=\"死锁-2pl-无法回避的代价\">死锁：2PL 无法回避的代价</h2><p>2PL 保证了正确，却引入了新问题：死锁。<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>T</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T_1</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 持有 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">x</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span></span></span></span></span> 的锁等 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>y</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">y</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">y</span></span></span></span></span>，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>T</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T_2</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 持有 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>y</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">y</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">y</span></span></span></span></span> 的锁等 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">x</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span></span></span></span></span>，两者互相等待，谁也走不下去。死锁是 2PL 的内在代价——只要允许事务按不同顺序加多把锁，就可能成环。处理死锁有三条路线。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>策略</th>\n<th>做法</th>\n<th>优点</th>\n<th>缺点</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>检测</td>\n<td>维护等待图，周期性查环，选牺牲者回滚</td>\n<td>不限制加锁行为，并发高</td>\n<td>检测有开销，回滚有浪费</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>预防</td>\n<td>用时间戳定序加锁（Wait-Die / Wound-Wait）</td>\n<td>永不死锁</td>\n<td>可能误杀本不会死锁的事务</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>超时</td>\n<td>等待超过阈值就回滚</td>\n<td>实现极简单</td>\n<td>阈值难调，误杀或拖延</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>主流数据库多用检测：维护一张等待图，节点是事务、边是「谁等谁」，周期性查环，发现环就挑一个代价最小的事务作为牺牲者回滚以打破环。MySQL InnoDB 与 PostgreSQL 都内置死锁检测，被选中的事务收到死锁错误、由应用重试。死锁回滚也要记日志，这与<a href=\"../recovery-durability/write-ahead-logging\">预写日志 WAL</a>的 undo 机制相连。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>两阶段锁用「先只加锁、再只放锁」这一条纪律，把可串行化的事后判据变成运行时可强制的规则。</li>\n<li>锁点理论证明了 2PL 保证冲突可串行化：按锁点排序即得等价串行序，优先图无环。</li>\n<li>严格 2PL 把写锁持有到提交，杜绝级联回滚，是工程标准；意向锁让多粒度加锁高效可行。</li>\n<li>死锁是 2PL 不可回避的代价，主流用等待图检测加牺牲者回滚来处理。</li>\n<li>锁是悲观方案，读多写少场景下其等待开销促成了<a href=\"mvcc\">MVCC</a>与<a href=\"optimistic-timestamp\">乐观并发</a>的兴起。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"两阶段锁与死锁","id":"两阶段锁与死锁"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"为什么两个阶段就能保证可串行化","id":"为什么两个阶段就能保证可串行化"},{"level":2,"text":"严格两阶段锁与级联回滚","id":"严格两阶段锁与级联回滚"},{"level":2,"text":"锁粒度与意向锁","id":"锁粒度与意向锁"},{"level":2,"text":"死锁：2PL 无法回避的代价","id":"死锁-2pl-无法回避的代价"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"可串行化理论","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/database-transactions-concurrency/foundations/serializability-theory"},"next":{"title":"多版本并发控制 MVCC","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/database-transactions-concurrency/concurrency-control/mvcc"}}